00:02:55.940 --> 00:03:02.500
visitors concentrate in large numbers. AP coverage describes the scale of the operation and the focus

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:09.080
on tourist sites where large numbers gather in summer. Local emergency services emphasize rapid

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:15.940
removal to avoid entrapment if flames advance. National weather agencies highlight how dry conditions and

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:21.920
wind patterns have increased fire danger across southwest France this season. Officials coordinated

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:27.000
transport and temporary shelter for those displaced from the campsites and holiday villages.

