seconds before the strongest tremors arrived. AP reporting notes the location on a seismically

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:12.120
active zone and the standard advisory procedures that follow such events. Local authorities focus on

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:17.520
checking infrastructure and transport links while residents follow established earthquake drills.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:23.940
The agency's early warning systems provided seconds of notice before shaking reached populated areas.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:30.400
Coastal communities received alerts about possible tsunami waves even though no major inundation

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:37.620
