00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:33.080
outside the listed categories. Reuters notes the targeted nature of the change, which covers

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:39.480
specific companies rather than a broad exemption. Energy ministry statements frame the move as support

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:46.040
